    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div>Hi Chris,<br><br></div>The format used to read from the data file isn&#39;t quite native R. I believe technical details on what&#39;s allowed is in the CmdStan manual, but it&#39;s really not worth reading.<br><br></div>The quick fix is to change x to:<br>x &lt;- <br>structure(c(1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 3, 1, 4, 1, 2, 2, 1),<br>.Dim = c(15, 1))<br><br></div>If you&#39;re using R to export the data, I&#39;d suggest using rstan&#39;s stan_rdump() function. It handles edge cases better than just using dump() in R.<br><br><br></div>Daniel<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
